    "enUS": {
      "description": "Here are the herbs, {name}. Take them to Witch Doctor Uzer'i.\n\nPlease let him know that I am satisfied with the shrunken head.",
      "dialogue": {
        "6118474f539b23253adc": "This is just what I need to prepare the muisek vessel, $N.  Soon we will see if my latest incantations prove to be as powerful as I had hoped.$B$BPlease, a moment. I must perform the ritual and apply the herbs.",
        "b8c4bd8e416dfbe95c3d": "Have you spoken to Neeru?",
        "eea8dc722ba28d4c9cb9": "Here are the herbs, $N. Take them to Witch Doctor Uzer'i.$B$BPlease let him know that I am satisfied with the shrunken head."
      },
      "summary": "Deliver Neeru's Herb Pouch to Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas.",
      "title": "Return to Witch Doctor Uzer'i",
